If {na} were to behave as any regular selbritcita, {na broda} would be=20
synonymous with {broda be naku} and {kai'u naku broda kei}. This way, it=20
would have minimal scope.
I've never used the maximal scope interpretation (I find it=20
counterintuitive with regard to the regular selbritcita paradigm), and=20
do not remember having witnessed it to be much used in current usage.

mi'e la .ilmen. mu'o

